    <briefdescription>
<para>Three-way project merge using a common ancestor snapshot. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The merge algorithm:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Compute ours_delta = diff(ancestor, ours)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Compute theirs_delta = diff(ancestor, theirs)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Apply non-conflicting deltas from theirs onto ours.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Report as conflicts any delta that modifies a field already changed by ours (same field_path, different value).</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>The merge never writes directly to any snapshot; callers are responsible for committing the resulting state. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
